      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "That's unfortunately just how it works in general. Animators on avatars do not activate for a user if the avatar is not currently rendering for that person (i.e. they aren't being looked at).\n\nOnly way around that would be to always have avatars rendered and that would be a massive performance loss in most situations.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
