      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "This should be a feature request for an sdk way to have avatar with multiple states, as now people are just making weird workarounds to somehow make this work. Often causing a lot of additional lag that would not be needed if this would be supported by SDK in some way.\n\nSadly currently they seems to be only focused on worlds and maintenance and avatars are not getting any features, so that will probably need to wait ;/",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
